name expex-acro
category Package
revision 68046
shortdesc Wrapper for the expex package
longdesc This is a small wrapper for the expex package, adding ways to
longdesc define, use, and summarize glossing abbreviations. It also
longdesc provides commands to refer to examples, as well as some inline
longdesc formatting commands commonly used in linguistics.
